      "action": "escalate_to_human",
      "amount_cents": null,
      "confidence": 0.7,
      "payload_json": "{\"decision\":{\"action\":\"escalate_to_human\",\"amount\":null,\"confidence\":0.7,\"reasoning\":[\"The dispute is a not-as-described claim for $118 on order VRD-1007. It is at the INQUIRY stage, and the available actions are accept, offer_refund and escalate_to_human. Contest is not available.\",\"The buyer's only message is \\\"N/A\\\" and there are no buyer notes. We don't know what is wrong with the item, so we can't tell whether it is damage (full refund under the playbook) or normal handmade variation (25-35% partial refund).\",\"Tracking shows USPS 9400111899560000100107 delivered 2026-11-03 to Columbus, OH 43215. The address matches the order and it was signed for by FRONT DESK. Delivery is not in question.\",\"The order is one Coffee grinder at $118. It has no prior refund and no internal note. The customer has 6 earlier orders to the same address and no disputes.\",\"The playbook says to send anything unusual to a human. An empty claim on a delivered, matching order doesn't fit a fixed refund tier, so the owner should decide. The owner could ask the buyer for a photo, as the damaged-item policy requires, before choosing between a full refund and a partial offer.\"],\"evidence\":[{\"type\":\"delivery_confirmation\",\"recordId\":\"ship-VRD-1007\",\"whyItHelps\":\"Shows delivery on 2026-11-03 to the order address, before the dispute was filed.\"},{\"type\":\"product_listing\",\"recordId\":\"p-grinder\",\"whyItHelps\":\"The listing describes a manual burr grinder with ceramic burrs and a walnut handle. It can be compared against whatever the buyer says is wrong.\"},{\"type\":\"customer_history\",\"recordId\":\"c-avery\",\"whyItHelps\":\"The buyer has 6 earlier orders to the same address with no disputes, which suggests a good-faith customer.\"}],\"risks\":[\"The buyer gave no details, so the real issue (damage, variation or a wrong item) is unknown.\",\"If the item arrived damaged, the playbook requires a full refund, and a partial offer would be the wrong response.\",\"Delivery was signed for by FRONT DESK, which is not necessarily the buyer. This is a minor point.\",\"The response is due 2026-11-30, so there is time to gather information, but the deadline still applies.\"],\"draftMessageToBuyer\":\"Hello Jordan, thank you for contacting us about your coffee grinder order. Your message didn't say what is wrong with the item. Could you send a short description and a photo so we can look into it? Our team is reviewing your case and will follow up soon.\"},\"validation\":{\"errors\":[],\"flags\":[\"Agent escalated to a human.\"]},\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-5-5\",\"promptVersion\":\"defender-v1\",\"packet\":{\"strength\":0.6,\"rating\":\"moderate\",\"gaps\":[\"No photos of the item as shipped.\"]}}",
      "status": "needs_human",
      "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:44:25.156Z"
