      "confidence": 0.85,
      "payload_json": "{\"decision\":{\"action\":\"accept\",\"amount\":47.4,\"confidence\":0.85,\"reasoning\":[\"The dispute PP-R-SLD-10197881 is an item-not-received claim for $47.40 on order VRD-1008. PayPal asked for proof of fulfillment.\",\"The shipment record ship-VRD-1008 shows USPS First-Class, untracked, shipped 2026-11-01 with no tracking number. Delivery cannot be proven.\",\"The evidence packet rates strength 0 (none), with the gap 'No tracking number: delivery cannot be proven.'\",\"Store policy says to refund in full when we cannot prove delivery. It also requires tracked shipping on orders over $30, and this order was untracked, so the fault is ours.\",\"The buyer's only message is 'N/A', which gives no reason to doubt the claim. The customer has 6 earlier orders with no disputes, so there are no fraud signals.\"],\"evidence\":[],\"risks\":[\"The shipment record ship-VRD-1008 hurts our case. It is untracked, so we cannot contest.\",\"The parcel may have been delivered. A full refund gives up the goods and the money, but the store cannot prove delivery.\",\"The order was shipped untracked despite the policy requiring tracking over $30. This is a process gap to fix.\",\"The customer history record c-avery helps (6 prior orders, no disputes), but it does not prove delivery.\"],\"draftMessageToBuyer\":\"Hello, thank you for contacting us. We are unable to confirm delivery of your order VRD-1008 because it shipped without tracking. We are sorry for the trouble and are refunding the full $47.40 through PayPal. Thank you for your patience and for shopping with Kiln & Co.\"},\"validation\":{\"errors\":[],\"flags\":[]},\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-5-5\",\"promptVersion\":\"defender-v1\",\"packet\":{\"strength\":0,\"rating\":\"none\",\"gaps\":[\"No tracking number: delivery cannot be proven.\"]}}",
